    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-memory-baseline",
        "moduleId": "memory-context",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：命令式语言与内存",
        "markdown": "命令式语言通过系统内存保存和操作程序状态。这类语言更自然地延续自汇编模型，因此理解大多数命令式编译器如何使用内存，是解释函数调用行为的基础。教材随后以 call stack 作为观察内存使用的第一个对象。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000020"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Pointers, References and Memory"
              ],
              "lineStart": 113,
              "lineEnd": 115,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "249d85ebe800a2309c75833aa5748488012b4b062d4dd883ac7af5221d1d7881"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-call-stack",
        "moduleId": "memory-context",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：调用栈要记住什么",
        "markdown": "从执行角度看，一次函数调用至少需要记住三件事：调用者传入了哪些参数、被调用函数创建了哪些局部变量，以及函数结束后应该回到哪里继续执行。call stack 的作用就是把这些信息按调用发生的顺序保存起来，使嵌套调用可以逐层返回。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-memory-baseline"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-stack-lifo",
        "moduleId": "stack-structure",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：栈与 push/pop",
        "markdown": "教材把 call stack 使用的结构定义为 stack：可以把它类比为一叠盘子，只能在顶部添加或取走元素。按惯例，向栈顶放入新条目的操作称为 push，从栈顶取走条目的操作称为 pop。这里的“盘子”就是 stack frame（栈帧）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000021"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Pointers, References and Memory",
                "The Call Stack for Functions"
              ],
              "lineStart": 116,
              "lineEnd": 119,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "5670b204d7207dce7cdfa4ef5877cfe761a93854c3a4ce78816f7aa37b4d78a7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-push-pop-rule",
        "moduleId": "stack-structure",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "模型补充：push 与 pop 的次序规则",
        "markdown": "push 与 pop 必须遵循后进先出：push 之后，最近进入的栈帧位于栈顶，只有它先被 pop，下面的栈帧才会重新成为栈顶。因此 CPU 在任何时刻都只直接处理栈顶帧，较早的调用必须等待更晚的调用返回后才能继续。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-stack-lifo"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-stack-frame",
        "moduleId": "stack-frame",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：栈帧的内容",
        "markdown": "每个 stack frame 保存该次调用所需的上下文：函数的参数、函数创建的局部变量，以及一个 return address。return address 告诉 CPU 在函数执行结束后应该跳转到哪里继续执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000021"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Pointers, References and Memory",
                "The Call Stack for Functions"
              ],
              "lineStart": 116,
              "lineEnd": 119,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "5670b204d7207dce7cdfa4ef5877cfe761a93854c3a4ce78816f7aa37b4d78a7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-frame-example",
        "moduleId": "stack-frame",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "模型补充：嵌套调用的帧布局",
        "markdown": "假设 `main` 调用 `f`，`f` 再调用 `g`。调用链形成后，栈底是 `main` 的栈帧，中间是 `f` 的栈帧，栈顶是 `g` 的栈帧。`g` 的帧记录着 `g` 的参数、局部变量和返回 `f` 的地址；`f` 的帧则记录返回 `main` 的地址。当 `g` 执行结束时，最先弹出的是 `g` 的栈帧。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-stack-frame"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-return-address",
        "moduleId": "call-and-return",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材：返回与退栈",
        "markdown": "当一个 procedure 执行完毕时，程序会删除它对应的栈帧，然后从保存的 return address 继续执行。此时栈顶回到上一层调用者的栈帧，控制权交还给调用者。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d998d2c477335adeea4bf2f2",
